Z||000006||Xtreme Fiero's||10-13-2000||08:15 AM||||84 SE:<P>Head unit: Eclipse 5341r<BR>Front stage: Eclipse 4X10's<BR>Rear fill: two sets of Eclipse 3.5" (headrests)<BR>Amps: PPI PC21400  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (1,400X1) & Eclipse 3321 (75X2)<BR>Sub(s): 10: Solobaric from Kicker<P>Souns awsome it will be even better when I get the New Solobaric in with the PPi amp. I have to get my bix from Chris west and open up the hole to a square. I shoud hit above 145db in single driver class 1501-2000 NSPL or 601-up IASCA. Is there a single driver class in IASCA or USAC? ||||reg||1
